Package: readboe
Title: Reproducible Access to Bank of England Statistical Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Chartwell", family = "Macro",
    email = "chartwellmacro@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")
    )
Description: Discovers, downloads, parses, and records provenance for official
    Bank of England statistical data. It covers the Interactive Statistical
    Database XML, CSV, and value-update interfaces, Bankstats bulk tables,
    official Bank Rate history, fitted yield curves, an audited statistical
    release registry, and saved Inflation Report and Monetary Policy Report
    forecasts, scenarios, conditioning paths and published distributions.
    Requests, caches, parsers, and snapshots use explicit bounds and preserve
    official identifiers, missing-value markers, source notices and revisions.
